  "slug": "auto-accident-policy-change-request-form",
  "title": "Auto Accident Policy Change Request Form",
  "subtitle": "A decision-ready auto accident policy change request that preserves identity, facts, evidence, authorization, exceptions, and accountable handoff without replacing the controlling policy or qualified judgment.",
  "description": "An original auto accident policy change request for collision event and involved vehicle with domain-specific intake, investigation, evidence, decision, escalation, audit, and closeout controls.",
  "use_case": "Use when the auto claim intake or adjusting owner must open and control a policy change request for collision event and involved vehicle. The record closes only after evidence and limitations are visible, authorized decisions are distinguishable from pending review, exceptions have owners, and the next recipient accepts the handoff.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
